Core Concepts: JVM, JRE, and JDK 
1. 🔥 JVM (Java Virtual Machine) 
Bhuwaneswari B 
Software Trainer 
 It is a virtual machine that runs Java bytecode. 
 JVM is platform-dependent (Windows/Linux), but bytecode is platform
independent. 
 Main Responsibilities: 
o Converts bytecode to machine code (via JIT compiler) 
o Manages memory (heap, stack) 
o Performs garbage collection 
o Ensures security and portability
